msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalacija"

msgid "Basic configuration"
msgstr "Pamatkonfiguracija"

msgid "Default gallery language"
msgstr "Galerijas valoda pec noklusešanas"

msgid "Database configuration"
msgstr "Datubazes konfiguracija"

msgid "Admin configuration"
msgstr "Administratora konfiguracija"

msgid "Start Install"
msgstr "Sakt instalaciju"

msgid "It will be shown to the visitors. It is necessary for website administration"
msgstr "Tas tiks radits apmekletajiem. Tas nepieciešams web lapas administrešanai"

msgid "Connection to server succeed, but it was impossible to connect to database"
msgstr "Savienojums ar serveri sekmigs, bet savienojums ar datu bazi nav iespejams"

msgid "Can't connect to server"
msgstr "Nevar savienoties ar serveri"

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Hosts"

msgid "User"
msgstr "Lietotajs"

msgid "user login given by your host provider"
msgstr "lietotaja logins, ko pieškir Jusu hosta pakalpojuma sniedzejs"

msgid "user password given by your host provider"
msgstr " lietotaja parole, ko pieškir Jusu hosta pakalpojuma sniedzejs"

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "Datu bazes nosaukums"

msgid "also given by your host provider"
msgstr "ari pieškir Jusu hosta pakalpojuma sniedzejs"

msgid "Database table prefix"
msgstr "Datu bazes tabulas prefikss"

msgid "database tables names will be prefixed with it (enables you to manage better your tables)"
msgstr "datu bazes tabulu nosaukumi bus ar šo prefiksu (lauj labak parvaldit Jusu tabulas)"

msgid "enter a login for webmaster"
msgstr "ievadit webmastera loginu"

msgid "webmaster login can't contain characters ' or \""
msgstr "webmastera logins nedrikst saturet ' vai \""

msgid "please enter your password again"
msgstr "ludzu ievadiet Jusu paroli no jauna"

msgid "Keep it confidential, it enables you to access administration panel"
msgstr "Esiet konfidenciali, tas lauj pieklut administratora panelim"

msgid "Password [confirm]"
msgstr "Parole [apstiprinat]"

msgid "verification"
msgstr "parbaude"

msgid "Need help ? Ask your question on <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo message board</a>."
msgstr "Vajag palidzibu? Uzdodiet savu jautajumu <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo sludinajumos</a>."

msgid "Visitors will be able to contact site administrator with this mail"
msgstr "Apmekletaji vares izmantot šo e-pastu, lai sazinatos ar lapas administratoru"

msgid "PHP 5 is required"
msgstr "nepieciešams PHP 5.2 "

msgid "It appears your webhost is currently running PHP %s."
msgstr "Jusu webhosts patlaban izmanto PHP %s."

msgid "Piwigo may try to switch your configuration to PHP 5 by creating or modifying a .htaccess file."
msgstr "Piwigo var meginat parslegt Jusu konfiguraciju uz  PHP 5.2 izveidojot vai modificejot  a .htaccess failu."

msgid "Note you can change your configuration by yourself and restart Piwigo after that."
msgstr "Jus varat izmanit savu konfiguraciju pats un pec tam parstartet Piwigo."

msgid "Try to configure PHP 5"
msgstr "Meginiet nokonfiguret PHP 5.2"

msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Atvainojiet!"

msgid "Piwigo was not able to configure PHP 5."
msgstr "Piwigo nevar nokonfiguret PHP 5.2"

msgid "You may referer to your hosting provider's support and see how you could switch to PHP 5 by yourself."
msgstr "Jums javeršas pie Jusu hostinga pakalpojuma sniedzeja pec palidzibas un pašam jamegina parslegties uz PHP 5.2 atbalstu."

msgid "Hope to see you back soon."
msgstr "Ceram Jus redzet atkal."

msgid "Congratulations, Piwigo installation is completed"
msgstr "Apsveicam, Piwigo instalacija ir pabeigta"

msgid "An alternate solution is to copy the text in the box above and paste it into the file \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Warning : database.inc.php must only contain what is in the textarea, no line return or space character)"
msgstr " Alternativa ir iekopet tekstu lodzina augšpuse un ielimet to faila \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Uzmanibu : database.inc.php drikst saturet tikai to kas ir teksta lodzina, ne enter ne tukšumus)"

msgid "Creation of config file local/config/database.inc.php failed."
msgstr "Konfigurācijas faila local/config/database.inc.php izveide ir nesekmīga."

msgid "Download the config file"
msgstr "Lejupladet config failu"

msgid "You can download the config file and upload it to local/config directory of your installation."
msgstr "Jums jalejupielade configuracijas fails un jaielade tas Jusu instalacijas local/config mape."

msgid "Just another Piwigo gallery"
msgstr "Vēl viena Piwigo galerija"

msgid "Welcome to my photo gallery"
msgstr "Laipni lūgti manā foto galerijā"

msgid "Welcome to your new installation of Piwigo!"
msgstr "Laipni lūgti Jūsu Piwigo jaunajā instalācijā!"

msgid "Don't hesitate to consult our forums for any help : %s"
msgstr "Nevilcinieties izmantot mūsu forumu palīdzību: %s"

msgid "localhost or other, supplied by your host provider"
msgstr "vietējais pakalpojuma sniedzējs vai cits, tas ko atbalsta vietējais pakalpojuma sniedzējs"

msgid "PHP version %s required (you are running on PHP %s)"
msgstr "Vajadzīga PHP %s versija (jūs izmantojat PHP %s)"

